# Why Claude, run once on its own to suggest a name, gave no answer.

error-one-shot-empty = the agent answered nothing
error-one-shot-failed = the agent stopped with an error
error-one-shot-no-agent = no agent that can answer is installed on this computer
error-one-shot-start = the agent could not start
error-one-shot-timed-out = the agent took too long to answer
